# notification-system-architecture

## Core Notification Workflows

1. Multi-Channel Distribution System
- Dual channel notifications (email + SMS) for order status updates
- Restaurant-specific order formatting templates
- Custom notification routing based on order type
Importance Score: 85

2. Template Management 
- Specialized food order notification templates
- Restaurant-specific order formatting logic
- Dynamic pickup time inclusion in messages
Importance Score: 75

## Notification Routing Logic

Primary notification paths (api/webhook.js):
- Order confirmation: Customer email + Restaurant SMS
- Order status changes: Customer SMS
- Pickup readiness: Dual channel alerts

Business rules for notifications:
1. Restaurant notifications must include:
   - Order number
   - Pickup time
   - Special instructions
   - Item customizations

2. Customer notifications:
   - Initial confirmation (email)
   - Status updates (SMS)
   - Pickup ready alert (both channels)

## Order Status Tracking

Status notification triggers:
- Order received
- Kitchen confirmed
- Preparation started
- Ready for pickup

Each status change generates appropriate notifications through the multi-channel system.

## Integration Points

Notification system connects with:
- Order processing system for initial triggers
- Restaurant management system for status updates
- Customer database for contact information

Importance Score: 80

